      "body": "Mrs. Rekha Jain, Mr. Mahendra Jain, Mrs. Meena Jain, Mr. Ravish Jain, Mr. Prakhar Jain, Mr. Manish Jain and Mr. Shekhar Jain agreed to acquire 52.55% stake in M.M. Metals Private Limited from ITL Industries Limited (BSE:522183) on March 17, 2026.\n\nThe transaction is subject to approval of merger agreement by target board. The deal has been approved by the board. The expected completion of the transaction is on or before March 31, 2026.",
